OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudier day in the southwest
OL,6,Fwith more frequent showers, some on
OL,7,Fthe heavy side. Drier with the best of
OL,8,Fthe sunnier spells towards
OL,9,FBerwickshire and East Lothian. Strong
OL,10,Fwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FScattered showers at first in
OL,13,Fthe southwest, largely fading out out
OL,14,Fthrough the evening and overnight.
OL,15,FOtherwise dry with clear spells and
OL,16,Fsome patchy rural frost possible in
OL,17,Fplaces.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
