OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F179A1791609927
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FAfter a quite chilly start it
OL,6,Fwill be dry with bright or sunny
OL,7,Fspells and light winds. Freshening
OL,8,Fwinds with cloud and patchy rain late
OL,9,Fin the southwest in evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FCloudier Monday with patchy rain.
OL,13,FEarly rain clearing on Tuesday then
OL,14,Fsunshine and showers, windy at times.
OL,15,FWindy on Wednesday with bright spells,
OL,16,Fvariable cloud and some outbreaks of
OL,17,Frain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
